// ---- COACHES ----
// Head coaches come and go. Each has a tenure; when it runs out he retires or moves on and a new coach is hired.
// The real-life nods (Bart Curtis at Mishawaka, Coach Yeoman at Penn, Michael Curtis at Warsaw) start every save and stay
// a long time; after them coaches change on their own, with the occasional legend who stays 25+ years.
// Cosmetic only: coaches never change ratings.
